  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請問～這位客人，\n您要不要搭個計程車看看？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB554FFF5E90194F4D5BA24EBAFF0C000A60A889814E0D8981642D500B8A087A0B8ECA770B770BFF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我才剛成為計程車司機，\n還沒載過人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211624D525B621070BA8A087A0B8ECA53F86A5FFF0C000A90846C928F09904E4EBA3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然稱不上是要當練習，\n但我想先習慣一下……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671367A314E0D4E0A662F898175767DF47FD2FF0C000A4F46621160F351487FD261634E004E0B20262026001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，我不會收您的錢的。\n請您幫我一個忙，從作為乘客<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n搭上我的計程車開始試試！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C62114E0D6703653660A87684932276843002000A8ACB60A85E6B62114E00500B5FD9FF0C5F9E4F5C70BA4E585BA200100001BE00000A642D4E0A621176848A087A0B8ECA958B59CB8A668A66FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，請您這就來向我搭話吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C8ACB60A890195C314F8654116211642D8A715427FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您要搭我的計程車嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A88981642D621176848A087A0B8ECA55CEFF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要搭車",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981642D8ECA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別啊……就當是日行一善，\n請您搭搭我的計程車吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5225554A202620265C317576662F65E5884C4E005584FF0C000A8ACB60A8642D642D621176848A087A0B8ECA54273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝！\n您是我的第1號客人喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1DFF01000A60A8662F621176847B2C0031865F5BA24EBA5594FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢中心：蓉粉",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59224E2D5FC3FF1A84C97C890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您要不要換個地方？\n我覺得我一定會迷路，到不了那裡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A889814E0D898163DB500B573065B9FF1F000A621189BA5F9762114E005B9A67038FF78DEFFF0C52304E0D4E8690A388E13002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那、那麼，我們出發了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3300190A39EBCFF0C6211501151FA767C4E86FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只有1個目的地，\n這樣的計程車很驚人吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA67090031500B76EE76845730FF0C000A90196A2376848A087A0B8ECA5F889A5A4EBA54273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為我覺得自己能不迷路就到的地方，\n只有那麼一處……不好意思。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA621189BA5F9781EA5DF180FD4E0D8FF78DEF5C3152307684573065B9FF0C000A53EA670990A39EBC4E008655202620264E0D597D610F601D3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我……最喜歡\n友友樂咖啡館的草莓塔了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211202620266700559C6B61000A53CB53CB6A0254965561992876848349839358544E863002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，我自己把話都說完了。\n不好意思。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C621181EA5DF1628A8A7190FD8AAA5B8C4E863002000A4E0D597D610F601D3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "街上多了不少野生寶可夢，\n計程車也越來越難開了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88574E0A591A4E864E0D5C1191CE751F5BF653EF5922FF0C000A8A087A0B8ECA4E5F8D8A4F868D8A96E3958B4E8654623002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話又說回來，既然是這樣，\n那我又為什麼要選擇當司機呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A7153C88AAA56DE4F86FF0C65E27136662F90196A23FF0C000A90A3621153C870BA4EC09EBC8981907864C7757653F86A5F54623002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我搞錯路了，讓我掉個頭。\n不好意思……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211641E932F8DEF4E86FF0C8B9362116389500B982D3002000A4E0D597D610F601D20262026001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "剛才我們是在說\n我為什麼要選擇當司機對不對。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "525B624D62115011662F57288AAA000A621170BA4EC09EBC8981907864C7757653F86A5F5C0D4E0D5C0D3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到了呢。\n寶可夢中心：蓉粉。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我們說好的，您不用付錢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52304E8654623002000A5BF653EF59224E2D5FC3FF1A84C97C89300200100001BE00000A621150118AAA597D7684FF0C60A84E0D75284ED893223002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝妳",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D59B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想付錢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F34ED893220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哪裡哪裡，\n謝謝您的搭乘。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54EA88E154EA88E1FF0C000A8B1D8B1D60A87684642D4E583002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那……那怎麼行……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但既然您都開口了，\n我就收<U+E300>710吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A32026202690A3600E9EBC884C2026202600100001BE01000A4F4665E2713660A890FD958B53E34E86FF0C000A62115C316536E30000370031003054273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那……那怎麼行……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但既然您都開口了，\n我就收<U+E300>710吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……那個……\n您的錢不夠呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A32026202690A3600E9EBC884C2026202600100001BE01000A4F4665E2713660A890FD958B53E34E86FF0C000A62115C316536E3000037003100305427300200100001BE01000A2026202690A3500B20262026000A60A8768493224E0D592054623002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "載過客人後，我明白自己\n究竟是多麼地遜到沒得救了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F09904E5BA24EBA5F8CFF0C6211660E767D81EA5DF1000A7A767ADF662F591A9EBC5730905C52306C925F9765514E863002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "開車或說話都暈頭轉向，\n這樣子乘客是會感到不安的吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B8ECA62168AAA8A7190FD6688982D8F495411FF0C000A90196A235B504E585BA2662F6703611F52304E0D5B89768454273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是我對寶可夢對戰可有自信了。\n請您務必和我交手！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F62115C0D5BF653EF59225C0D623053EF670981EA4FE14E863002000A8ACB60A852D95FC5548C62114EA4624BFF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第1號客人，\n請您務必和我對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C0031865F5BA24EBAFF0C000A8ACB60A852D95FC5548C62115C0D6230FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒問題",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92554F984C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會讓您稍微看到\n我不錯的一面的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038B9360A87A0D5FAE770B5230000A62114E0D932F76844E00976276843002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託您和我對戰吧。\n我會讓您看到我不錯的一面的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1760A8548C62115C0D623054273002000A621167038B9360A8770B523062114E0D932F76844E0097627684FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "連寶可夢對戰也是遜到沒得救了呢……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90235BF653EF59225C0D62304E5F662F905C52306C925F9765514E86546220262026001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是和客人您對戰，\n明明是輸了卻覺得好開心！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F548C5BA24EBA60A85C0D6230FF0C000A660E660E662F8F384E86537B89BA5F97597D958B5FC3FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這果然是因為我有持續在寶可夢對戰，\n所以對自己有信心吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019679C7136662F56E070BA6211670963017E8C57285BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0C000A62404EE55C0D81EA5DF167094FE15FC354273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果我繼續當計程車司機，\n相信也就會對自己有信心了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n……要是我能堅持下去的話。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C62117E7C7E8C75768A087A0B8ECA53F86A5FFF0C000A76F84FE14E5F5C3167035C0D81EA5DF167094FE15FC34E86FF0100100001BE00000A202620268981662F621180FD580563014E0B53BB76848A713002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
